# Security

Never commit secrets. Use `.env.local` locally, Vercel env vars for the app, and GitHub Actions secrets for migrations.

Never put service-role keys in frontend code or `NEXT_PUBLIC_` variables.

Never trust the browser for payment status, bid validity, quota availability, seller balances, payout eligibility, settlement status, or admin permissions.

Never edit immutable quota or financial ledgers in place. Corrections use adjustment or reversal entries.

Use database transactions for concurrent quota and money operations.

Payment and webhook handling must be idempotent.
